						"Ready, sir."
						"Deploy!"

						They power up their weapons and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.
						Whoever they are, these guys don't mess around!</text>
					<environment type="PDS" target="player"/>
					<ship hostile="true"/>
					
					<choice hidden="true">
						<text>Continue...</text>
