	</choice>
	
	<choice req="DJMOD_HAS_RADIKAL_GEAR" lvl="1" hidden="true" blue="false">
		<text>You have RadiKal (RK) gear, which by definition is illegal almost everywhere.
			Right now, that could cost you dearly, as that ship seems to be scanning it specifically!</text>
		<event load="OPTION_INVALID"/>
	</choice>

	<choice req="DJMOD_HAS_RADIKAL_GEAR" lvl="1" hidden="true" blue="true">
		<text>...I don't like this one bit. Attack!</text>
		<event name="RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK">
			<text>You don't even have time to give the order. That ship must have been scanning you since the moment you jumped in. And they have already decided to eliminate you!
				
				"Judgement be passed on you, despicable Chaos sympathising terrorists. I never could find the ones directly responsible, but at least you will pay for Zeta-708T56-C Secundus's Northern Moonbase!"
			
			They power up their weapons (which seem tailored to destroy RK ships) and simultaneously eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support.
			Whoever they are, these guys don't mess around!</text>
			<environment type="PDS" target="player"/>
			<ship hostile="true"/>

			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event>
					<text>A sudden explosion also makes your ears ring. They must have used some sort of combat augment on your Engines!</text>
