<event name="DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_INTRO">
	<text>As soon as the ship is defeated, your scanners detect multiple micro-charges detonating inside it, ruining most of the salvage. Whatever control freak supervises these guys doesn't leave much to chance.
		
		With the auxiliary ship way out of your range and still firing, you grab some meager scrap.</text>
	<autoReward level="LOW">scrap_only</autoReward>
	
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>What a punishing fight. Is that the real cost of using RadiKal gear? No matter, take a quick look around, then let's move!</text>
		<event load="DEFEAT_RK_A_POLICE_LOOT_CHANCE"/>
	</choice>
	<!-- <choice hidden="true">
		<text>What a punishing fight. Is that the real cost of using RadiKal gear? No matter, let's move!</text>
		<event/>
	</choice> -->
</event>
