<event name="RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_GOODEND_RK_WEAPONLIKE">
	<text>They bring you the slave (actually a pair of them) and remove their restraints, apparently relieved to get rid of him. "Drive." is all they say. You diplomatically nod and welcome them aboard.</text> 
	<crewMember amount="2" combat="2" class="rk_weaponlike"/>
	<choice>
		<text>I think they'll fit right in.</text>
		<event load="REPUTATION_UPDATE_SLAVER"/>
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_GOODEND_RK_FIREGHOST">
	<text>They bring you the slave and remove his restraints, apparently relieved to get rid of him. "I wasn't stuck in there with them. They were stuck in there with me." says the freshly freed troublesome slave. You diplomatically nod and welcome them aboard.</text> 
	<crewMember amount="1" combat="2" class="rk_fireghost"/>
	<choice>
		<text>I think they'll fit right in.</text>
		<event load="REPUTATION_UPDATE_SLAVER"/>
	</choice>
</event>

<event name="RADIKAL_ENSLAVED_BADEND_LOSTSUN">
	<text>They bring you the slave and remove his restraints so quickly that you haven't even transferred all the scrap yet. Unfortunately the troublemaker doesn't seem to like the way some of your crew look at him, and starts punching! 
	You interrupt the scrap transfer and watch the slavers immediately jump away, leaving you to deal with him.</text>
	<item_modify>
		<item type="scrap" min="10" max="20"/>
	</item_modify>
	<instantEscape/>
	
	<boarders min="1" max="1" class="rock_commando"/>
	<choice>
		<text>So that's why he was so cheap.</text>
		<event load="REPUTATION_UPDATE_SLAVER"/>
	</choice>
</event>
