			<weapon name="GIFTLIST_FITTING_ION_SCORCH"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>

</FTL>

<FTL>
<event name="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS">
	<text>It appears a damaged beam-wielding RadiKal ship is under attack by a smuggler, certainly to steal their special tech. They are on their last legs but their trajectory forces them to pass you by for a slim chance at escaping.</text>
	<ship load="SHIP_SMUGGLER_RK_BEAMS" hostile="false"/>
	
	<choice>
		<text>Rescue the RadiKals.</text>
		<event>
			<text>You give the smuggler ship no choice but to fight you as you fly towards it full speed.</text> 
			<ship hostile="true"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="COMBAT_CHECK"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	
	<choice hidden="true" req="weapons" lvl="6">
		<text>(Upg. Weapons) Claim the prey for yourself.</text>
		<event>
			<text>"Woh hoh hoh, hey, wait, that's our-" They quickly change their mind as the rest of the crew pressures them. "You know what, screw this, have fun with you ill-gotten goods." Quite ironic, coming from a smuggler. The Radikals are quickly dealt with.</text>
			<autoReward level="LOW">standard</autoReward>
			
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Search the ship a little more.</text>
				<event>
					<text>There was a functional RadiKal augment in the cargo! Must be what the smugglers were after. Looks like you're the thief now.</text>
					<augment name="GIFTLIST_AUGMENT_RADIKAL"/>
				</event>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Ignore them.</text>
		<event>
			<text>The RadiKal ship soon stops moving, and the pirates re-open comms to thank you for not interfering, toss you a scrap bag through an airlock, and jump away. You briefly wonder what could have put them in such a good mood.</text>
			<item_modify>
				<item type="scrap" min="5" max="10"/>
			</item_modify>
			
			<choice>
				<text>Do something onboard the ship.</text>
				<event load="STORAGE_CHECK"/>
			</choice>
			<choice>
				<text>Do nothing.</text>
				<event/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
<ship name="SHIP_SMUGGLER_RK_BEAMS" auto_blueprint="LIST_SHIPS_SMUGGLERS">
	<!-- <surrender chance="0.4" min="2" max="3" load="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD_SURR"/> -->
	<destroyed load="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD"/>
	<deadCrew load="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD_CREWKILL"/>
</ship>

<event name="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD_SURR">
	<text load="TEXT_SURRENDER_PIRATE"/>
	<choice>
		<text>Accept their surrender.</text>
		<event>
			<ship hostile="false"/>
			<autoReward level="LOW">stuff</autoReward>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Go and check on their ex-prey.</text>
				<event load="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice>
		<text load="GENERIC_SURRENDER_CHOICE_NOMERCY"/>
		<event/>
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD">
	<text>"Without you we were toast. Have this as thanks."</text>
	<autoReward level="LOW">standard</autoReward>
	
	<choice>
		<text>What did they want from you?</text>
		<event load="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_END"/>
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_REWARD_CREWKILL">
	<text>"Without you we were toast. Have this as thanks."</text>
	<autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
	
	<choice>
		<text>What did they want from you?</text>
		<event load="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_END"/>
	</choice>
</event>

<event name="THIEVES_RK_BEAMS_END">
	<text>"The usual, local tech. Surely you understand that we can't just give it to you either. However we can provide you one beam weapon from our cargo that fits your preferred RadiKal subfaction, that would only be fair. Which one is it?"</text> 
	
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Bam</text>
		<event>
			<text>They transfer the weapon and wish you safe travels.</text> 
			<weapon name="GIFTLIST_FITTING_BEAM_BAM"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Punk</text>
		<event>
			<text>They transfer the weapon and wish you safe travels.</text> 
			<weapon name="GIFTLIST_FITTING_BEAM_PUNK"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Scorch</text>
		<event>
			<text>They transfer the weapon and wish you safe travels.</text> 
			<weapon name="GIFTLIST_FITTING_BEAM_SCORCH"/>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>

</FTL>

<!-- 
*********************************************************************************************************
*********************************************************************************************************
Empty beacons
*********************************************************************************************************
*********************************************************************************************************
