<event name="RKS_EXIT_PIRATE_TRINITY_AMBUSH">
	<text>Just as you were about to jump, a serious warship in pirate colors come out of hiding, followed by more pirates.
		"Forgetting something? A lil' business meeting that YOU asked for, maybe? Have you no honor??! You can't just make a bunch of cutthroats waste their time. Now die, fool!"</text>
	<clearJumpEvent/>

	<!-- <resetFtl/>		Should now be blocked completely by the ship itself. -->

	<!-- Only possible after Gatekeeper fights thanks to multiShipFix in hyperspace.xml.append -->
	<!-- <ship load="SHIP_PIRATE_ELITE_STARGROVE" hostile="true"/> -->
	<ship load="SHIP_RKS_EXIT_PIRATE_AMBUSHER"/>
	<!-- <environment type="PDS" target="player"/> -->

	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Oh, that's what the weird feeling was about.</text>
		<event>
			<text>Looks like the pirates really didn't appreciate you not coming to your own Pirate Trinity reunion. They are somehow jamming your jump drive too! You'll have to fight them to leave, as the RadiKals don't seem willing to pick a side here.</text>
			<ship hostile="true"/>
			
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Nothing to do here but fight!</text>
				<event load="COMBAT_CHECK"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
