<ship name="SHIP_RKS_EXIT_PIRATE_AMBUSHER" auto_blueprint="RKS_EXIT_PIRATE_AMBUSHER">
	<!-- <surrender  chance="0.4" min="2" max="3" load="SURRENDER_PIRATE"/> -->
	<escape chance="1" min="2" max="9" load="ESCAPE_PIRATE"/>
	<gotaway load="GOTAWAY_PIRATE"/>
	<destroyed>
		<text>"NOOO-" The pirate captain is cut off by their ship's explosion.

			Most of the RadiKals are not so pleased.
			"Didn't we tell you to make sure to pay these guys if you said you would? Now we're gonna have delivery issues for a while."
			
			The others make signs of approbation, their faces remaining unhappy.
			"HAH, I mean this WAS such a good fight it would have been a shame to miss it, but at what cost?" "Yesss this asssshole had it coming, but he wassss alssso doing a lot of good work."
			
			"Tell you what, you earned that wreck, so scrap it nice and clean. That will be your part of cleaning up this mess. We'll take care of the rest if you can just make yourself scarce until this dies down."
			It's clear that the news will spread regardless, but the RadiKals seem ready to spin this story in a neutral light. Your reputation among Pirates should not be ruined.</text>
		<autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>

		<choice hidden="true">
			<text>Time to leave before they change their minds.</text>
			<event load="RK_MORALITY_REMOVE_GENERAL_DOUBLE"/>
		</choice>
	</destroyed>
	<deadCrew>
		<text>"NOOOooo-" The pirate captain dies before they can finish.

			Most of the RadiKals are not so pleased.
			"Didn't we tell you to make sure to pay these guys if you said you would? Now we're gonna have delivery issues for a while."
			
			The others make signs of approbation, their faces remaining unhappy.
			"HAH, I mean this WAS such a good fight it would have been a shame to miss it, but at what cost?" "Yesss this asssshole had it coming, but he wassss alssso doing a lot of good work."
			
			"Tell you what, you earned that wreck, so scrap it nice and clean. That will be your part of cleaning up this mess. We'll take care of the rest if you can just make yourself scarce until this dies down."
			It's clear that the news will spread regardless, but the RadiKals seem ready to spin this story in a neutral light. Your reputation among Pirates should not be ruined.</text>
		<autoReward level="HIGH">standard</autoReward>

		<choice hidden="true">
			<text>Time to leave before they change their minds.</text>
			<event load="RK_MORALITY_REMOVE_GENERAL_DOUBLE"/>
		</choice>
	</deadCrew>
	<!-- <crew>
		<crewMember type="zoltan" prop="0.50"/>
		<crewMember type="zoltan_peacekeeper" prop="0.50"/>	
	</crew> -->
</ship>

